{"seq":2,"slug":"audio-engine-architecture","title":"音频引擎架构：Wwise、FMOD 与 Audio Manager 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/audio-fundamentals/audio-engine-architecture","wordCount":977,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"音频引擎架构-wwise-fmod-与-audio-manager-模式\">音频引擎架构：Wwise、FMOD 与 Audio Manager 模式</h1><p>游戏音频引擎不仅是「播放声音的模块」，而是管理数百个并发声音实例、动态资源加载、跨平台 API 抽象和实时 DSP 处理的复杂子系统。理解中间件（Wwise/FMOD）的内部架构，有助于正确集成、调试性能问题和设计自定义扩展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Event 驱动架构</strong>：游戏逻辑通过语义事件（Play_Gunshot）触发音频，不直接指定文件路径，实现逻辑与实现解耦。</li>\n<li><strong>SoundBank</strong>：将音频资产打包为运行时加载单元，按场景/关卡管理加载/卸载生命周期。</li>\n<li><strong>Voice 池（Voice Pool）</strong>：预分配固定数量的音频通道，按优先级截断超额声音，避免运行时内存分配。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"音频引擎的职责分层\">音频引擎的职责分层</h2><p>一个完整的游戏音频引擎承担四个层次的职责：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[游戏逻辑层\\nGame Logic] --&gt; B[音频管理层\\nAudio Manager]&#10;    B --&gt; C[中间件层\\nWwise / FMOD / 自研]&#10;    C --&gt; D[平台 API 层\\nXAudio2 / AAudio / CoreAudio]&#10;    D --&gt; E[硬件驱动\\nAudio Hardware]&#10;&#10;    B &lt;-.-&gt; F[资源系统\\nAsset System]&#10;    C &lt;-.-&gt; G[DSP 插件\\nDSP Plugins]\">flowchart TB\n    A[游戏逻辑层\\nGame Logic] --&gt; B[音频管理层\\nAudio Manager]\n    B --&gt; C[中间件层\\nWwise / FMOD / 自研]\n    C --&gt; D[平台 API 层\\nXAudio2 / AAudio / CoreAudio]\n    D --&gt; E[硬件驱动\\nAudio Hardware]\n\n    B &lt;-.-&gt; F[资源系统\\nAsset System]\n    C &lt;-.-&gt; G[DSP 插件\\nDSP Plugins]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>典型接口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>游戏逻辑层</td>\n<td>触发事件、设置参数</td>\n<td><code>AudioManager::PlayEvent()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频管理层</td>\n<td>声音池、优先级、生命周期</td>\n<td><code>SoundInstance</code> 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间件层</td>\n<td>混音图、DSP 处理、空间化</td>\n<td>Wwise API / FMOD Studio API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台 API 层</td>\n<td>驱动缓冲、硬件输出</td>\n<td>XAudio2 / CoreAudio</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"wwise-架构深度解析\">Wwise 架构深度解析</h2><p>Wwise（Audiokinetic Wwise）是主流 AAA 游戏首选的音频中间件，其架构围绕<strong>事件驱动</strong>和<strong>层次化结构</strong>设计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心对象层级\">核心对象层级</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SoundBank .bnk] --&gt; B[Event 事件]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Action 动作]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Sound Object]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Audio Source\\n.wav/.ogg]&#10;    B --&gt; F[RTPC\\n实时参数]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Switch\\n状态切换]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Actor-Mixer\\n混音器]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Bus 总线]&#10;    I --&gt; J[Master Bus\\n主总线]\">graph TD\n    A[SoundBank .bnk] --&gt; B[Event 事件]\n    B --&gt; C[Action 动作]\n    C --&gt; D[Sound Object]\n    D --&gt; E[Audio Source\\n.wav/.ogg]\n    B --&gt; F[RTPC\\n实时参数]\n    B --&gt; G[Switch\\n状态切换]\n    D --&gt; H[Actor-Mixer\\n混音器]\n    H --&gt; I[Bus 总线]\n    I --&gt; J[Master Bus\\n主总线]</pre><p><strong>Event（事件）</strong>：游戏触发的最小单元，如 <code>Play_Footstep_Grass</code>。一个 Event 可包含多个 Action（播放/停止/设置参数）。</p>\n<p><strong>RTPC（实时参数控制）</strong>：允许游戏实时传入数值（0–100），映射到音量、音调、效果量等任意参数。典型用途：将角色速度映射到脚步声音量。</p>\n<p><strong>Switch（切换组）</strong>：根据游戏状态（如地面材质 = Grass/Stone/Metal）切换不同音频资产，逻辑保留在 Wwise 中而非游戏代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 游戏代码侧的 Wwise 集成&#10;#include &lt;AK/SoundEngine/Common/AkSoundEngine.h&gt;&#10;&#10;// 触发事件&#10;AK::SoundEngine::PostEvent(&#10;    AK::EVENTS::PLAY_FOOTSTEP_GRASS,&#10;    gameObjectID&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 设置 RTPC（玩家速度影响音效强度）&#10;AK::SoundEngine::SetRTPCValue(&#10;    AK::GAME_PARAMETERS::PLAYER_SPEED,&#10;    currentSpeed,  // 0.0 - 10.0&#10;    gameObjectID&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 切换地面材质&#10;AK::SoundEngine::SetSwitch(&#10;    AK::SWITCHES::SURFACE_TYPE,&#10;    AK::SWITCHES::SURFACE_TYPE_STONE,&#10;    gameObjectID&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 游戏代码侧的 Wwise 集成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;AK/SoundEngine/Common/AkSoundEngine.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 触发事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SoundEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PostEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    AK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">EVENTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::PLAY_FOOTSTEP_GRASS,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gameObjectID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置 RTPC（玩家速度影响音效强度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SoundEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetRTPCValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    AK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GAME_PARAMETERS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::PLAYER_SPEED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currentSpeed,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 0.0 - 10.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gameObjectID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 切换地面材质</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SoundEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetSwitch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    AK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SWITCHES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::SURFACE_TYPE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    AK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SWITCHES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::SURFACE_TYPE_STONE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gameObjectID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"wwise-内存与流式系统\">Wwise 内存与流式系统</h3><p>Wwise 将声音分为三种加载策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>内存模式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Loaded in Memory</td>\n<td>完全预加载到内存</td>\n<td>零延迟</td>\n<td>高频短音效（UI、武器）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Streaming</td>\n<td>实时流式读取</td>\n<td>约 200-500ms 启动延迟</td>\n<td>BGM、长环境音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prefetch + Stream</td>\n<td>前若干帧预加载，其余流式</td>\n<td>极低延迟</td>\n<td>中等长度音效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fmod-架构解析\">FMOD 架构解析</h2><p>FMOD Studio 采用基于**时间轴（Timeline）**的编辑范式，更直观但灵活性略低于 Wwise。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[FMOD Bank] --&gt; B[Event\\n时间轴]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Track 轨道]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Audio Clip]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Parameter\\n参数]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Parameter Sheet\\n自动化曲线]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Logic Track\\n逻辑触发]\">graph LR\n    A[FMOD Bank] --&gt; B[Event\\n时间轴]\n    B --&gt; C[Track 轨道]\n    C --&gt; D[Audio Clip]\n    B --&gt; E[Parameter\\n参数]\n    E --&gt; F[Parameter Sheet\\n自动化曲线]\n    B --&gt; G[Logic Track\\n逻辑触发]</pre><p><strong>参数（Parameter）</strong>：FMOD 的 RTPC 等价物。Timeline 上的素材位置可以绑定到参数值，形成参数化音景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// FMOD Studio C++ API&#10;FMOD::Studio::System* system;&#10;FMOD::Studio::System::create(&amp;system);&#10;system-&gt;initialize(512, FMOD_STUDIO_INIT_NORMAL, FMOD_INIT_NORMAL, nullptr);&#10;&#10;FMOD::Studio::EventDescription* eventDesc;&#10;system-&gt;getEvent(&quot;event:/Footstep/Grass&quot;, &amp;eventDesc);&#10;&#10;FMOD::Studio::EventInstance* instance;&#10;eventDesc-&gt;createInstance(&amp;instance);&#10;&#10;// 设置 3D 属性&#10;FMOD_3D_ATTRIBUTES attrs = {{pos.x, pos.y, pos.z}, {vel.x, vel.y, vel.z}};&#10;instance-&gt;set3DAttributes(&amp;attrs);&#10;&#10;instance-&gt;start();&#10;instance-&gt;release();  // 播放完自动释放\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FMOD Studio C++ API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FMOD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Studio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::System</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> system;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FMOD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Studio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">System</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">system);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">system-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">initialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, FMOD_STUDIO_INIT_NORMAL, FMOD_INIT_NORMAL, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nullptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FMOD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Studio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::EventDescription</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventDesc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">system-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"event:/Footstep/Grass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eventDesc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FMOD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Studio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::EventInstance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eventDesc-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置 3D 属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FMOD_3D_ATTRIBUTES attrs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {{pos.x, pos.y, pos.z}, {vel.x, vel.y, vel.z}};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set3DAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">attrs);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 播放完自动释放</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自研-audio-manager-模式\">自研 Audio Manager 模式</h2><p>对不使用商业中间件的项目（或中间件上层封装），自研 Audio Manager 是标准架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"classDiagram\" data-source=\"classDiagram&#10;    class AudioManager {&#10;        -SoundPool soundPool&#10;        -MixerGraph mixerGraph&#10;        -StreamingManager streamMgr&#10;        +PlayEvent(eventName, pos, params)&#10;        +StopEvent(handle)&#10;        +SetParameter(handle, name, value)&#10;        +Update(deltaTime)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    class SoundPool {&#10;        -vector~SoundInstance~ instances&#10;        -int maxVoices&#10;        +Acquire() SoundInstance*&#10;        +Release(instance)&#10;        +StealLowestPriority()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    class SoundInstance {&#10;        +uint64 handle&#10;        +AudioClip* clip&#10;        +float volume, pitch, pan&#10;        +int priority&#10;        +Transform3D position&#10;        +Status status&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    AudioManager --&gt; SoundPool&#10;    AudioManager --&gt; MixerGraph&#10;    SoundPool --&gt; SoundInstance\">classDiagram\n    class AudioManager {\n        -SoundPool soundPool\n        -MixerGraph mixerGraph\n        -StreamingManager streamMgr\n        +PlayEvent(eventName, pos, params)\n        +StopEvent(handle)\n        +SetParameter(handle, name, value)\n        +Update(deltaTime)\n    }\n\n    class SoundPool {\n        -vector~SoundInstance~ instances\n        -int maxVoices\n        +Acquire() SoundInstance*\n        +Release(instance)\n        +StealLowestPriority()\n    }\n\n    class SoundInstance {\n        +uint64 handle\n        +AudioClip* clip\n        +float volume, pitch, pan\n        +int priority\n        +Transform3D position\n        +Status status\n    }\n\n    AudioManager --&gt; SoundPool\n    AudioManager --&gt; MixerGraph\n    SoundPool --&gt; SoundInstance</pre><h3 id=\"声音优先级与截断策略\">声音优先级与截断策略</h3><p>游戏场景可能同时触发数百个声音事件，但硬件 Voice 数量有限（通常 32-128）。优先级系统决定哪些声音被截断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 声音优先级计算（0 = 最高优先级）&#10;int computePriority(const SoundInstance&amp; inst, const Vector3&amp; listenerPos) {&#10;    float distance = (inst.position - listenerPos).length();&#10;    float distanceFactor = std::min(distance / MAX_AUDIBLE_DISTANCE, 1.0f);&#10;&#10;    // 基础优先级 + 距离惩罚 + 音量加成&#10;    int priority = inst.basePriority&#10;                 + (int)(distanceFactor * 50)&#10;                 - (int)(inst.volume * 20);&#10;&#10;    return std::clamp(priority, 0, 255);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 语音截断：当 Voice 满时，驱逐最低优先级&#10;SoundInstance* SoundPool::stealLowestPriority(const Vector3&amp; listenerPos) {&#10;    auto worst = std::max_element(instances.begin(), instances.end(),&#10;        [&amp;](const SoundInstance&amp; a, const SoundInstance&amp; b) {&#10;            return computePriority(a, listenerPos) &lt; computePriority(b, listenerPos);&#10;        });&#10;    return &amp;(*worst);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 声音优先级计算（0 = 最高优先级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computePriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SoundInstance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> inst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listenerPos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (inst.position </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listenerPos).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distanceFactor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_AUDIBLE_DISTANCE, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24